# Bow release (graphics/mesh/bowdraw, reports/archery/2026-11-03-release-follow-through): the drawing hand
# flies back to the ear, the bow hand is thrown back a moment, the bow turns in the hand and rings, as hard
# as the bow stored (Archery::releaseKick: a light bow drawn half 0.15, a heavy one drawn fully 1).
# Every take is slowed 8 times (slowmo 8: a frame is 1/240 s of the game): every 4th frame is the shot at
# 60 fps, all of them at 60 fps are 0.25 of the speed. Columns bd_back (cm the drawing hand is from where
# it let go), bd_kick (cm the bow hand is thrown back), bd_turn (degrees the bow turns in the hand) beside
# hd_hand, bd_bowmiss, bd_overgrip, rh_*; the log's "arrow shot ... draw" is f.
# `bowrelease off` (OPENGOTHIC_BOWRELEASE=0): as before (the hand 4 cm back and to the face again)
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_01
turn 225
wait 500
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 100
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1000 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body

stats str 15 dex 15 bow 10 talent 1
tap bow
wait 1500
animinfo S_BOWAIM S_BOWSHOOT T_BOWRELOAD
stats talent auto

# 1. a light bow, a weak archer, drawn half (let go as it gets there): from the side, in front
stats str 15 dex 15 bow 10
cam follow 220 150 90             # the left side: the arrow's line across the frame
cam look 145
wait 300
slowmo 8
rec light_half_side
volley 1 0 0.5
wait 300
stop
slowmo 1
cam follow 170 150 -50            # in front, on the right: the drawing hand past the face
wait 300
slowmo 8
rec light_half_front
volley 1 0 0.5
wait 300
stop
slowmo 1
# the same as before the release (bowrelease off): the reload's own jerks and the bow in the hand to compare
cam follow 220 150 90
cam look 145
wait 300
bowrelease off
slowmo 8
rec light_half_off
volley 1 0 0.5
wait 300
stop
slowmo 1
bowrelease on

# 2. a heavy bow, a strong archer, drawn fully: from the side, in front
equip ItRw_Bow_H_03
give ItRw_Arrow 40
wait 300
tap bow
wait 1500
stats str 120 dex 120 bow 100
cam follow 220 150 90
cam look 145
wait 300
slowmo 8
rec heavy_full_side
volley 1 400 1
wait 300
stop
slowmo 1
cam follow 170 150 -50
wait 300
slowmo 8
rec heavy_full_front
volley 1 400 1
wait 300
stop
slowmo 1

# 4. the master's series: three shots, the reload at the master's tempo (dexterity), from the side
cam follow 220 150 90
cam look 145
wait 300
slowmo 8
rec master_series
volley 3 300
wait 300
stop
slowmo 1

# 5. as the player sees it: the game's camera over the shoulder
view full
cam game
wait 500
slowmo 8
rec game
volley 2 300
wait 300
stop
slowmo 1
view clean
tap bow
wait 1000

# 3. an NPC archer (a bandit, its own bow: `archers` prints its draw weight and r) shooting at the hero, from the side
goto NW_BIGFARM_VORPOSTEN1_01_RIGHTFIELD_02
turn 210
wait 500
clear 3000
immortal player on
still player on
arc BDT_1003_BANDIT_M 1 1350 0
wait 300
stats npc BDT_1003_BANDIT_M talent auto
npcaim on second
archers
archer all at player
watch BDT_1003_BANDIT_M
cam follow 260 150 90
wait 2000
slowmo 8
rec npc_side
wait 5000
stop
slowmo 1
archer off
